0..74 Comment "// A bare lambda that ends a body is read as the box that the body returns"
75..150 Comment "// only where the expected type returns a box of a function. Two cases keep"
151..226 Comment "// their `return`, and each is refused here. A box of a computation that is"
227..294 Comment "// no function has no lambda to read, so the lambda is refused with"
295..368 Comment "// `ShapeMismatch`. A definition that states no type gives no box to read"
369..430 Comment "// against, so its lambda is refused with `NotSynthesisable`."
431..433 Comment "//"
434..449 Comment "// - see: #6390"
